{"1669689257328271361":{"a":"<p>@tualgorithm I locked up my social accounts ahead of the stupidening and have been sticking to my following feed to avoid the trending sidebar hallucinations. I figure it&#x27;ll pass in a week or fifty. Also, agreed on the golf.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/tualgorithm/status/1669685204930232323\">https://x.com/tualgorithm/status/1669685204930232323</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1669689257328271361</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669689257328271361\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-06-16T12:51:54Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1669805580234399745":{"a":"<p>RT @CherokeeNation: &quot;We’re just beginning to assert our #sovereignty and our #treatyrights&quot;: Principal Chief @ChuckHoskin_Jr talks with @po…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669805580234399745\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669805580234399745</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1669805580234399745</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669805580234399745\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-06-16T20:34:08Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1669806156447985665":{"a":"<p>RT @CandaceSchupay1: BeautIful 50 ft sculpture named &quot;Dignity&quot; honoring the cultures of Lakota and Dakota women. ❤️ t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1669806156447985665-FywatTMXsAABWpa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669806156447985665\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669806156447985665</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1669806156447985665</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669806156447985665\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-06-16T20:36:25Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1669807671560527874":{"a":"<p>Certainly not today. Maybe in 6-12 years if education is subsidized, working conditions and time off improve, and pay is fair. There&#x27;s no point learning those expensive to obtain skills if there&#x27;s no outlook for employment. China started 40 years ago. We stopped 30 years ago. <a href=\"https://x.com/ForeignPolicy/status/1669804541221429250\">Tweet by @ForeignPolicy</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ForeignPolicy/status/1669804541221429250\">https://x.com/ForeignPolicy/status/1669804541221429250</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1669807671560527874</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669807671560527874\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-06-16T20:42:27Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1669815678809808897":{"a":"<p>I read that as, &quot;Make content for free or we&#x27;re going to steal your content and give it to someone else.&quot; <a href=\"https://x.com/padresj/status/1669813757999218690\">Tweet by @padresj</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/padresj/status/1669813757999218690\">https://x.com/padresj/status/1669813757999218690</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1669815678809808897</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1669815678809808897\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-06-16T21:14:16Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1669831756805992450":{"a":"<p>Well I know what I am watching tonight.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.